<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Contact Us - VelocityX</title>
  <link href="https://i.imgur.com/xnzyBi9.png" rel="shortcut icon"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/bootstrap.min.css"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/font-awesome.min.css"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css"/>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #0a0e1a; color: #e2e8f0; }
    .vx-legal-hero { padding: 120px 0 60px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #060912 0%, #0a0e1a 100%); }
    .vx-legal-hero h1 { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .vx-legal-hero p { font-size: 16px; color: #94a3b8; }
    .vx-legal-body { padding: 60px 0; background: #0a0e1a; }
    .vx-legal-content { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .vx-legal-back { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; transition: color 0.3s; }
    .vx-legal-back:hover { color: #3b82f6; }
    .vx-contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .vx-contact-card { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s; }
    .vx-contact-card:hover { border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.3); transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .vx-contact-card i { font-size: 32px; color: #3b82f6; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .vx-contact-card h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .vx-contact-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; }
    .vx-contact-card a { color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; }
    .vx-contact-card a:hover { color: #3b82f6; }
    .vx-contact-section h2 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 40px 0 16px; }
    .vx-contact-section h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    .vx-contact-section p { font-size: 15px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .vx-contact-section a { color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none; }
    .vx-contact-section a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="vx-legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/" class="vx-legal-back"><i class="fa fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Home</a>
      <h1>Contact Us</h1>
      <p>We're here to help. Reach out with any questions or concerns.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="vx-legal-body">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="vx-legal-content">
        <div class="vx-contact-grid">
          <div class="vx-contact-card">
            <i class="fa fa-envelope"></i>
            <h3>Email Support</h3>
            <p><a href="mailto:support@velocityx-ai.com">support@velocityx-ai.com</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="vx-contact-card">
            <i class="fa fa-clock-o"></i>
            <h3>Support Hours</h3>
            <p>24/7 Customer Service</p>
          </div>
          <div class="vx-contact-card">
            <i class="fa fa-shield"></i>
            <h3>Security</h3>
            <p><a href="mailto:security@velocityx-ai.com">security@velocityx-ai.com</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="vx-contact-card">
            <i class="fa fa-question-circle"></i>
            <h3>Help Center</h3>
            <p>Log in and visit the Support Center for FAQs and guides</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vx-contact-section">
          <h2>General Inquiries</h2>
          <p>For questions about your account, deposits, withdrawals, or any feature of the platform, our support team is available around the clock. The fastest way to reach us is through the in-platform Support Center after logging in, or by emailing <a href="mailto:support@velocityx-ai.com">support@velocityx-ai.com</a>.</p>

          <h2>Security Concerns</h2>
          <p>If you suspect unauthorized access to your account or any security issue, contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:security@velocityx-ai.com">security@velocityx-ai.com</a>. Include your account email and a description of the issue. We will respond as quickly as possible.</p>

          <h2>Legal and Compliance</h2>
          <p>For legal, regulatory, or compliance matters, please email <a href="mailto:legal@velocityx-ai.com">legal@velocityx-ai.com</a>. Please include relevant references such as your account ID or transaction number.</p>

          <h2>Response Times</h2>
          <p>We strive to respond to all inquiries within 24 hours. Complex issues may take longer, but we will keep you informed of progress throughout.</p>

          <h2>Mailing Address</h2>
          <p>VelocityX<br>Trading Platform Support<br>support@velocityx-ai.com</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script src="js/jquery-3.2.1.min.js"></script>
  <script src="js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
